    "section_faq_NDxnwX": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_RpDMKk": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I choose the correct curtain width and length?",
            "content": "<p>Our team of trusted engineers created a simple-to-use <a href=\"/pages/curtain-calculator\" title=\"Curtain Calculator\">Curtain Measurement Calculator</a> to help you determine your curtain panel size. Choose your style and tailoring, give us two measurements, and we'll do the rest.</p>",
            "action_text": "MORE CURTAIN FAQS",
            "action_link": "shopify://blogs/pep-talk/curtain-faqs"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_iDgwty": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What PILLOW SIZES DO YOU OFFER?",
            "content": "<p>We offer Square (18\", 20\", 22\"), Euro (26\" x 26\"), Bolster (8.5\" x 24\"), Petite Lumbar (12\" x 21\"), Midi Lumbar (16\" x 24\") and XL Lumbar (19\" x 47\").<br/><br/>Please see our <a href=\"/blogs/pep-talk/pillow-faqs\" title=\"Pillow FAQs\">Size Guide</a> to determine your perfect size.</p>",
            "action_text": "MORE PILLOW FAQS",
            "action_link": "shopify://blogs/pep-talk/pillow-faqs"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_A3ykG6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "IS THE WALLPAPER BATHROOM FRIENDLY?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! We recommend using our performance wallpaper in bathrooms. The water and stain resistant material is extremely durable and wipeable. Clay coated wallpaper may be used in ventilated bathrooms as long as it is not placed in splash zones.</p>",
            "action_text": "MORE WALLPAPER FAQS",
            "action_link": "shopify://blogs/pep-talk/wallpaper-faqs"
          }
        }
      },
